{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t在北京，外交部回應美國中期選舉結果，發言人毛寧表示，中期選舉是美國內政，中方願意繼續與美方一起，維護好、落實好兩國元首重要共識，加強溝通，妥處分歧，拓展合作，構建基於尊重、公平、對等的中美建設性戰略穩定關係。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:48.576083+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:13:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:57.413395+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:43.199211+00:00","content_hash":"2614eabb5e7e9d7700147ef332e7e7cfc8c0e61b77d87e9de84290949844dcc7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}